"<main role=\"main\" aria-label=\"Premium Health Checkup - Comprehensive Health Screening\" class=\"min-h-screen bg-white\"><section class=\"relative min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-900 via-indigo-900 to-blue-900\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-black/30\"></div><div class=\"relative z-10 max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center text-white py-32\"><div style=\"opacity: 1; transform: none;\"><p class=\"text-lg text-blue-200 mb-4 tracking-wider\">Health Checkup Programme</p><h1 class=\"text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-bold mb-6\">Premium International Health Checkup</h1><p class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl text-blue-200 mb-4\">高端国际健康筛查</p><p class=\"text-lg text-gray-300 max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-4\">Comprehensive Panoramic Package</p><p class=\"text-base text-gray-400 max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-8\">Designed for high-end visitors to China | One checkup · Six deep screenings · Complete privacy</p><div class=\"flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4 mb-8\"><span class=\"px-4 py-2 bg-white/10 rounded-full text-sm\">World-Class Equipment</span><span class=\"px-4 py-2 bg-white/10 rounded-full text-sm\">AI-Assisted Diagnosis</span><span class=\"px-4 py-2 bg-white/10 rounded-full text-sm\">Same-Day Reports</span><span class=\"px-4 py-2 bg-white/10 rounded-full text-sm\">Complete Privacy</span></div><div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-4\"><button class=\"px-8 py-4 bg-blue-500 text-white font-semibold rounded-lg hover:bg-blue-600 transition-colors\">View Packages</button><button class=\"px-8 py-4 border-2 border-white text-white font-semibold rounded-lg hover:bg-white/10 transition-colors\">Learn More</button></div></div></div></section><section id=\"intro\" class=\"py-20 lg:py-32 bg-white\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 lg:gap-20 items-center\"><div style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateX(-30px);\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-6\">Why Choose China for Your Health Checkup?</h2><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-lg mb-6\">China's top medical centers are now equipped with world-class advanced equipment and AI-assisted diagnostic systems.</p><p class=\"text-gray-600 mb-6\">You can perfectly combine your annual in-depth checkup with a luxury trip. Fastest: morning checkup, afternoon report, immediate expert review, enjoy the rest of your journey.</p><div class=\"flex items-center space-x-4 text-blue-600\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle \"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><span class=\"font-semibold\">Precision Checkup + Luxury Travel in One Stop</span></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"py-20 lg:py-32 bg-slate-50\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"text-center mb-16\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-4\">Core Advantages</h2><p class=\"text-gray-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto\">Why choose our premium health checkup service</p></div><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-8\"><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-sm\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"w-16 h-16 bg-blue-100 text-blue-600 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-microscope \"><path d=\"M6 18h8\"></path><path d=\"M3 22h18\"></path><path d=\"M14 22a7 7 0 1 0 0-14h-1\"></path><path d=\"M9 14h2\"></path><path d=\"M9 12a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V6h6v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2Z\"></path><path d=\"M12 6V3a1 1 0 0 0-1-1H9a1 1 0 0 0-1 1v3\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-4\">World-Class Advanced Equipment</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600\">Equipped with 256-slice spectral CT, 3.0T ultra-high-field MRI, fully digital PET-CT, and AI-assisted diagnostic systems, improving small lesion detection rate by 50%.</p></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-sm\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"w-16 h-16 bg-blue-100 text-blue-600 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6\"><svg width=\"40\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"1\" x2=\"12\" y2=\"23\"></line><path d=\"M17 5H9.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 0 7h5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0 7H6\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-4\">Significant Cost Advantage</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600\">For equivalent quality checkup packages, pricing in mainland China is only 35%-45% of US prices.</p></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-sm\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"w-16 h-16 bg-blue-100 text-blue-600 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-clock \"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><polyline points=\"12 6 12 12 16 14\"></polyline></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-4\">Ultimate Efficiency Experience</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600\">Full appointment-based process with same-day core examination reports and expert interpretation. Fastest: morning checkup, afternoon report, immediate expert review.</p></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-sm\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"w-16 h-16 bg-blue-100 text-blue-600 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield \"><path d=\"M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-4\">Privacy Protection First</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600\">VIP independent examination area completely separated from regular areas, one-on-one private communication, gender-separated zones, highest-level encryption for health data.</p></div></div></div></section><section class=\"py-20 lg:py-32 bg-white\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"text-center mb-16\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-4\">Who Is It For?</h2></div><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6\"><div class=\"bg-blue-50 rounded-xl p-6 flex items-start gap-4\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"w-8 h-8 bg-blue-500 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 text-sm font-bold\">1</div><p class=\"text-gray-700\">Global corporate executives, entrepreneurs, high-net-worth family members</p></div><div class=\"bg-blue-50 rounded-xl p-6 flex items-start gap-4\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"w-8 h-8 bg-blue-500 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 text-sm font-bold\">2</div><p class=\"text-gray-700\">Aged 30-65, concerned about cardiovascular, skeletal, tumor, and digestive health</p></div><div class=\"bg-blue-50 rounded-xl p-6 flex items-start gap-4\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"w-8 h-8 bg-blue-500 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 text-sm font-bold\">3</div><p class=\"text-gray-700\">Long-term desk work, high-pressure jobs, cervical/lumbar spine health issues</p></div><div class=\"bg-blue-50 rounded-xl p-6 flex items-start gap-4\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"w-8 h-8 bg-blue-500 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 text-sm font-bold\">4</div><p class=\"text-gray-700\">Family history of tumors, cardiovascular/cerebrovascular diseases, or digestive disorders</p></div><div class=\"bg-blue-50 rounded-xl p-6 flex items-start gap-4\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"w-8 h-8 bg-blue-500 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 text-sm font-bold\">5</div><p class=\"text-gray-700\">Want to combine precision checkup with luxury travel, highly value privacy and efficiency</p></div></div></div></section><section class=\"py-20 lg:py-32 bg-slate-900 text-white\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"text-center mb-16\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-4\">Core Customization System: \"1+X+Y\"</h2><p class=\"text-gray-400 max-w-2xl mx-auto\">Essential base package + Six deep screening modules + Personalized extension modules</p></div><div class=\"mb-12\"><h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-blue-400 mb-6\">\"1\" - Essential Base Package</h3><div class=\"bg-slate-800 rounded-2xl p-8\"><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-blue-400 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><p class=\"text-gray-300 text-sm\">General examination (height/weight/BMI, blood pressure, pulse)</p></div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-blue-400 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><p class=\"text-gray-300 text-sm\">Physical examination: internal medicine, surgery, ophthalmology, ENT, dentistry</p></div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-blue-400 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><p class=\"text-gray-300 text-sm\">Routine tests: complete blood count, urinalysis + sediment, fecal occult blood</p></div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-blue-400 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><p class=\"text-gray-300 text-sm\">Comprehensive biochemistry: 12 liver function items, 5 kidney function items, 8 lipid profile items (including ApoA, ApoB, ApoE, Lp(a)), fasting glucose + HbA1c</p></div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-blue-400 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><p class=\"text-gray-300 text-sm\">Myocardial injury markers: troponin, cardiac enzyme panel</p></div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-blue-400 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><p class=\"text-gray-300 text-sm\">Immunity &amp; inflammation: rheumatism panel, immunoglobulins, hs-CRP</p></div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-blue-400 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><p class=\"text-gray-300 text-sm\">Infectious disease screening: Hepatitis B/C, syphilis, HIV</p></div></div></div></div><div class=\"mb-12\"><h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-blue-400 mb-6\">\"X\" - Six Deep Screening Modules</h3><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6\"><div class=\"bg-slate-800 rounded-xl p-6\"><h4 class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-4 text-white\">1. Cardiovascular Deep Screening</h4><ul class=\"space-y-2\"><li class=\"text-gray-300 text-sm flex items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"text-blue-400\">•</span>256-slice spectral CT coronary CTA</li><li class=\"text-gray-300 text-sm flex items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"text-blue-400\">•</span>CT-FFR functional assessment (non-invasive myocardial ischemia judgment, accuracy &gt;95%)</li><li class=\"text-gray-300 text-sm flex items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"text-blue-400\">•</span>Echocardiography + 3D reconstruction</li><li class=\"text-gray-300 text-sm flex items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"text-blue-400\">•</span>24-hour Holter ECG (optional), arteriosclerosis detection</li><li class=\"text-gray-300 text-sm flex items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"text-blue-400\">•</span>Carotid ultrasound + intima-media thickness (IMT) measurement</li><li class=\"text-gray-300 text-sm flex items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"text-blue-400\">•</span>Cardiac enzyme panel, troponin, homocysteine</li></ul></div><div class=\"bg-slate-800 rounded-xl p-6\"><h4 class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-4 text-white\">2. Cerebrovascular Deep Screening</h4><ul class=\"space-y-2\"><li class=\"text-gray-300 text-sm flex items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"text-blue-400\">•</span>3.0T ultra-high-field brain MRI plain scan + DWI</li><li class=\"text-gray-300 text-sm flex items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"text-blue-400\">•</span>Brain MRA (vascular stenosis, aneurysm, malformation)</li><li class=\"text-gray-300 text-sm flex items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"text-blue-400\">•</span>Carotid plaque stability assessment, transcranial Doppler (TCD)</li><li class=\"text-gray-300 text-sm flex items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"text-blue-400\">•</span>Alzheimer's disease-related proteins + APOE genotyping</li><li class=\"text-gray-300 text-sm flex items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"text-blue-400\">•</span>Brain wave stress analysis + cognitive function scale</li></ul></div><div class=\"bg-slate-800 rounded-xl p-6\"><h4 class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-4 text-white\">3. Cervical &amp; Lumbar Spine Deep Screening</h4><ul class=\"space-y-2\"><li class=\"text-gray-300 text-sm flex items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"text-blue-400\">•</span>70cm large-bore 3.0T research-grade cervical spine MRI, lumbar spine MRI</li><li class=\"text-gray-300 text-sm flex items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"text-blue-400\">•</span>Dual-energy X-ray bone density (DXA) - whole body + spine + hip</li><li class=\"text-gray-300 text-sm flex items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"text-blue-400\">•</span>Osteoporosis three serum markers (25-OH vitamin D, TRAP 5b, CTX-I)</li></ul></div><div class=\"bg-slate-800 rounded-xl p-6\"><h4 class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-4 text-white\">4. Knee Joint Deep Screening</h4><ul class=\"space-y-2\"><li class=\"text-gray-300 text-sm flex items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"text-blue-400\">•</span>Knee MRI (meniscus, ligaments, cartilage, patellofemoral joint)</li><li class=\"text-gray-300 text-sm flex items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"text-blue-400\">•</span>Bone density + bone lesion assessment</li><li class=\"text-gray-300 text-sm flex items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"text-blue-400\">•</span>Comprehensive joint function assessment (range of motion, gait analysis)</li><li class=\"text-gray-300 text-sm flex items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"text-blue-400\">•</span>Key bone metabolism indicators: vitamin D, K, etc.</li></ul></div><div class=\"bg-slate-800 rounded-xl p-6\"><h4 class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-4 text-white\">5. Tumor Deep Screening</h4><ul class=\"space-y-2\"><li class=\"text-gray-300 text-sm flex items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"text-blue-400\">•</span>Complete tumor marker panel (CEA, AFP, CA19-9, CA125, PSA, etc.)</li><li class=\"text-gray-300 text-sm flex items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"text-blue-400\">•</span>Seven lung cancer autoantibodies + VEGF</li><li class=\"text-gray-300 text-sm flex items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"text-blue-400\">•</span>Low-dose chest spiral CT - gold standard for early lung cancer screening</li><li class=\"text-gray-300 text-sm flex items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"text-blue-400\">•</span>Fully digital PET-CT whole-body scan or 3.0T whole-body diffusion-weighted imaging</li><li class=\"text-gray-300 text-sm flex items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"text-blue-400\">•</span>Liquid biopsy multi-cancer early screening (ctDNA methylation analysis)</li><li class=\"text-gray-300 text-sm flex items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"text-blue-400\">•</span>Whole exome sequencing (WES)</li></ul></div><div class=\"bg-slate-800 rounded-xl p-6\"><h4 class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-4 text-white\">6. Digestive Tract Deep Screening</h4><ul class=\"space-y-2\"><li class=\"text-gray-300 text-sm flex items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"text-blue-400\">•</span>Painless sleep gastroscopy/colonoscopy (imported anesthesia, synchronous polyp removal)</li><li class=\"text-gray-300 text-sm flex items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"text-blue-400\">•</span>Or magnetic-controlled capsule endoscopy (non-invasive, painless)</li><li class=\"text-gray-300 text-sm flex items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"text-blue-400\">•</span>C13/C14 breath test (Helicobacter pylori)</li><li class=\"text-gray-300 text-sm flex items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"text-blue-400\">•</span>Stool SDC2 gene methylation test (early colorectal cancer screening)</li></ul></div></div></div><div><h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-blue-400 mb-6\">\"Y\" - Personalized Extension Modules (Optional)</h3><div class=\"bg-slate-800 rounded-2xl p-8\"><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-4\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><span class=\"text-blue-400 font-bold\">+</span><p class=\"text-gray-300 text-sm\">Functional medicine integrated analysis (vitamin groups, amino acid profiles, trace elements, gut microbiota)</p></div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><span class=\"text-blue-400 font-bold\">+</span><p class=\"text-gray-300 text-sm\">Complete allergen panel (17 inhalation + 14 food items)</p></div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><span class=\"text-blue-400 font-bold\">+</span><p class=\"text-gray-300 text-sm\">Autoimmune disease screening (antinuclear antibody panel)</p></div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><span class=\"text-blue-400 font-bold\">+</span><p class=\"text-gray-300 text-sm\">Cardiovascular drug genetic testing</p></div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><span class=\"text-blue-400 font-bold\">+</span><p class=\"text-gray-300 text-sm\">Ce